        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          On carpet, a treadmill mat has a different job from the one it does on a hard floor. It has to spread the load so the frame does not rock, keep fibres away from the motor and stay flat on a surface that moves. Here are five mats that do that, matched to carpet pile and machine size.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="#picks" class="bg-[#FF5A1F] hover:bg-[#E64F16] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
            See the Picks
          </a>
          <a href="#rigid-vs-soft" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm border border-white/20">
            Rigid or Soft?
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- Author & Meta -->
