            <a href="#rubber-cal-treadmill-mat" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Rubber-Cal Treadmill Mat (4 x 7.5 ft)</a>
            <a href="#rubber-cal-treadmill-mat" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Best for Long Treadmills:</span>
            <a href="#supermats-29gs" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">SuperMats 29GS Solid Equipment Mat (3 x 8.5 ft)</a>
            <a href="#supermats-29gs" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Best for Compact Treadmills:</span>
            <a href="#supermats-30gs" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">SuperMats 30GS Heavy Duty Equipment Mat (30 x 72 in.)</a>
            <a href="#supermats-30gs" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Best Budget:</span>
            <a href="#amazon-basics-treadmill-mat" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Amazon Basics Treadmill Mat (2.5 x 6 ft)</a>
            <a href="#amazon-basics-treadmill-mat" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Best for Walking Pads:</span>
            <a href="#gymcope-treadmill-mat" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">GymCope Treadmill Mat (6 mm)</a>
            <a href="#gymcope-treadmill-mat" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mt-0 mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#FF5A1F]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"></path></svg>
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#quick-picks" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">1. Our Picks at a Glance</a>
          <a href="#picks" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. The 5 Best Treadmill Mats for Carpet</a>
          <a href="#carpet-problems" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. What Carpet Changes</a>
          <a href="#rigid-vs-soft" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. Rigid or Soft: Why Firm Mats Win on Carpet</a>
